## v0.2 bounded correction

The revision adds:

- Breeder Rounds from Today;
- persistent tank/project/cohort context through each round item;
- one-tap routine feed where an explicit breeder-recorded routine already exists;
- one-tap no-hatch and no-loss check semantics without fabricating biological events;
- Undo for one-tap and bulk routine actions;
- bulk routine feed with explicit cohort selection;
- physical tank-label shortcut simulation;
- round summaries separating shared Journal care events from breeder-only observations;
- same-event-ID verification between Breeder and Journal.

Quick Log remains available for structured or non-routine logging. Consequential cohort/inventory actions are not converted into blind one-tap mutations.

