## Known limitations

- local/synthetic single-user prototype only;
- no production authentication, backend, sync, notification, QR/OCR, camera-scanner, payment, genetics, live AI, or sensor implementation;
- tank-label scanning is represented by a picker;
- one-tap feed is available only where the demo contains an explicit remembered routine;
- Chromium producer qualification does not establish Safari/native-device qualification;
- user-feedback sources informed the product correction but do not prove market fit.

